    "biography": {
      "sourceURL": "https://filthyanimals.com.au/",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Formed during the COVID lockdowns from a desire to perform while members were separated from their primary acts, The Filthy Animals grew from five players into a rotating collective of more than 30 performers.",
        "The fluid five-piece lineup draws current, original and former members associated with Dragon, Mondo Rock, John Butler Trio, Savage Garden, Wolfmother, Choirboys, The Vines, The Superjesus and other Australian acts.",
        "Built for festivals, corporate events and private functions, the set spans classic rock hits the audience knows, forgotten favourites and songs the musicians have performed or recorded across their individual careers."
      ]
    }
